Here are a number of easy to implement suggestions, that would make
nethack easier for beginners and low-levels characters, and more
difficult for experienced players and high-level characters.

- Let wands of polymorph use one charge for each item or monster being
polymorphed.

- Let intrinsic protections have a (long) time-out.

- Remove wands of wishing from the game.  Replace the wand with a
magic lamp in the castle level. 

- Make it impossible to wish for named weapons.

- Make it impossible to get a named weapon from the Gods.

- Give the priest in Gehennom a named weapon, so the player have one
in Hell.

- Make intelligent monsters immune to conflict.

- Restrict wand zapping to high-level monsters, especially the more
deadly wands.  A Gnome Lord should be allowed to zap magic missiles.

- Make being killed when polymorphed lower your CON attribute, and if
it is too low (< 5) you die for real.

- Make food consumption lower, but let high stats and/or intrinsic
raise it.

- Make regeneration faster for low level characters, and slower for
high-level characters compared to now.  

- A chrysknife should be significantly better than all other non-named
weapons.

- If maxhp is over 100, it should very slowly decrease.  Carrying
Yendor could raise this to 150.

- Players should be forced to drop all all items that do not fit the
players character class when entering the endgame.

What do you think?


